# See ste/references/README.md.

# The source and everything derived from its full text.
ASD-STE100*.pdf
ASD-STE100*.txt
**/references/word-index.tsv
**/references/rules.md

# Keep the manifest and the README. They contain no text of the standard.
!**/references/MANIFEST.sha256
!**/references/README.md
